{"id":"cac035693aea2791","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-liar-sentence.md","title":"说谎者及保留句法的对角构造","display":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者及保留句法的对角构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-liar-sentence","aliases":["91-df-liar-sentence"],"display":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者及保留句法的对角构造","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-liar-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-liar-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者及保留句法的对角构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" href=\"?note=ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth\">91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 是由句法递归定理取得的基础语言闭项，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash l=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg T(l)\\urcorner}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash l=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg T(l)\\urcorner}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>只为关于一般理论的经典论证另保留双条件关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 不含真理公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\lambda\\coloneqq\\neg T(l),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\lambda\\coloneqq\\neg T(l),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Liar}_{S,T}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land S\\vdash[\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Liar}_{S,T}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land S\\vdash[\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的说谎者断言“我不真”；它不是内部断言“我的否定是真的”。取保留句法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\">\\(\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\\)</span>，才能在非经典语义中直接用真值子句。\n仅仅某个经典算术理论证明双条件，不保证任意经典等价改写在强 Kleene 下同值；所有三值分类使用这里固定的闭项构造。\n加入对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的全 T 双条件会矛盾；一致固定点让它保持间隙，裸 KF 的不一致信息固定点则可含其两侧。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 14.3，印刷页 146，PDF 页 157；Lemma 15.1，印刷页 183，PDF 页 194。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","status":"resolved","id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash l=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg T(l)\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\lambda\\coloneqq\\neg T(l),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Liar}_{S,T}(\\gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land S\\vdash[\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1587,"backlinks":[{"id":"387103572d3822c3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"性质中的公式量化与 $S\\vdash$ 都在元层。由对角引理，所给算术背景满足本性质；详见 [[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]] 的构造。\n旧定义把未说明的 $\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\operatorname{diag})$ 合取进性质，混淆证明所用的可表示性条件与结论性质。现已移除这一未定义黑箱。\n经典 PA 可证的双条件并不自动成为强 Kleene 语义中的透明等价。分析三值说谎者时须使用 [[91-df-liar-sentence]] 的闭项直接自指构造。"},{"id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d12ffdb5e1b32a31","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\lambda=\\neg T(l)$ 为 [[91-df-liar-sentence]] 的闭项说谎者，$c=\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner$；KF 不含 CONS。"},{"id":"80b21a90a0262f70","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\lambda=\\neg T(l)$，闭项 $l$ 的标准值为 $\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner$，使用 [[91-df-liar-sentence]] 的直接自指实现。"},{"id":"5349915a17c515d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[